# These names are GENERATED ARTIFACTS, and the patterns above are unanchored, so
# they match at any depth. That silently swallowed the flow check's contract when
# it was added — `git add -A` reported nothing, the commit went out without it, and
# CI was the first thing to notice. Specification documents are never generated
# output, so exempt the directory that holds them.
!specs/**/contracts/prisma-flow.md
!specs/**/contracts/ai-disclosure.md
